<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") -%>
<style>
  body {
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
    background: #f0fdf4;
    color: #065f46;
    padding: 2rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .policy-container {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: auto;
    background: #ffffff;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 128, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .policy-container h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: #047857;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .policy-container h2 {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    color: #065f46;
  }

  .policy-container p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .policy-container ul {
    margin-left: 1.5rem;
    list-style-type: disc;
  }

  footer {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    color: #065f46;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
</style>

<div class="policy-container">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

  <p>At <strong>RecycleConnect</strong>, we are committed to protecting your privacy and handling your data responsibly. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you interact with our services.</p>

  <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
  <p>We may collect the following types of personal information:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Name and contact details (email, phone)</li>
    <li>Location data (for map and event services)</li>
    <li>Photos, posts, or comments you share</li>
    <li>Technical data such as browser type and device info</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To display posts, events, and community activity</li>
    <li>To improve user experience and platform performance</li>
    <li>To notify you of updates, events, and activities</li>
    <li>To ensure community safety and compliance</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Sharing of Information</h2>
  <p>We do <strong>not</strong> sell or rent your data. We may share data only:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>With service providers (hosting, analytics)</li>
    <li>To comply with legal obligations</li>
    <li>To protect users from harm or fraud</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
  <p>We use cookies to analyze traffic, improve functionality, and personalize content. You can control cookie settings in your browser.</p>

  <h2>5. Data Security</h2>
  <p>We implement appropriate technical and organizational safeguards to protect your data against unauthorized access and misuse.</p>

  <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
  <p>You have the right to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Access or update your personal data</li>
    <li>Request data deletion</li>
    <li>Withdraw consent to data use</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy occasionally. We’ll notify you of significant changes via the website or email.</p>

  <h2>8. Contact Us</h2>
  <p>If you have questions about this policy, reach out at <a href="mailto:support@recycleconnect.com">support@recycleconnect.com</a>.</p>

  <footer>&copy; 2025 RecycleConnect. All rights reserved.</footer>
</div>
